{"seq":2,"slug":"chemistry-salinity","title":"海水化学与盐度","url":"/l-doc-books/h/geography-geopolitics/oceanography/foundations/chemistry-salinity","wordCount":1486,"readingTime":6,"html":"<h1 id=\"海水化学与盐度\">海水化学与盐度</h1><p>海水尝起来咸，但&quot;咸&quot;远不足以概括它。一升海水里溶着约 35 克盐，几乎包含了元素周期表上所有的天然元素，还封存着比大气更多的二氧化碳。最值得注意的是一个被反复验证的规律：无论取自红海还是南极，主要离子之间的比例几乎恒定。这条&quot;恒定比例定律&quot;和海水的碳酸盐缓冲系统，是本篇的核心——前者解释了海洋化学的稳定性，后者解释了为什么海洋能吸碳、又为什么正在酸化。密度如何随盐度变化已在<a href=\"physical-properties\">海洋的物理性质</a>讲过，本篇专注于&quot;水里溶了什么、它们如何反应&quot;。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念-盐度与主要离子\">核心概念：盐度与主要离子</h2><p>盐度（salinity）指海水中溶解盐类的总量，现代用实用盐标（PSS-78）通过电导率测定，记为无量纲的 PSU，全球海洋平均约 35。海水中六种主要离子就占了溶解盐总量的约 99%：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>离子</th>\n<th>占溶解盐质量百分比</th>\n<th>主要来源</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>氯离子 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">C</mi><msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">l</mi><mo>−</mo></msup></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\mathrm{Cl^-}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7713em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathrm\">C</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathrm\">l</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.7713em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mbin mtight\">−</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></td>\n<td>55.0%</td>\n<td>火山脱气、岩石风化</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>钠离子 Na⁺</td>\n<td>30.6%</td>\n<td>大陆岩石风化</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>硫酸根 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">S</mi><msubsup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">O</mi><mn>4</mn><mrow><mn>2</mn><mo>−</mo></mrow></msubsup></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\mathrm{SO_4^{2-}}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.1205em;vertical-align:-0.2663em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathrm\">S</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathrm\">O</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8542em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.4337em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathrm mtight\">4</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.1031em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathrm mtight\">2</span><span class=\"mord mtight\">−</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2663em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></td>\n<td>7.7%</td>\n<td>风化与火山</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>镁离子 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">M</mi><msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">g</mi><mrow><mn>2</mn><mo>+</mo></mrow></msup></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\mathrm{Mg^{2+}}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.0085em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathrm\">M</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathrm\" style=\"margin-right:0.0139em;\">g</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8141em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathrm mtight\">2</span><span class=\"mord mtight\">+</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></td>\n<td>3.7%</td>\n<td>风化</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>钙离子 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">C</mi><msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">a</mi><mrow><mn>2</mn><mo>+</mo></mrow></msup></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\mathrm{Ca^{2+}}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8141em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathrm\">C</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathrm\">a</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8141em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathrm mtight\">2</span><span class=\"mord mtight\">+</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></td>\n<td>1.2%</td>\n<td>风化（造壳消耗）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>钾离子 K⁺</td>\n<td>1.1%</td>\n<td>风化</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart TD&#10;  A[河流输入离子] --&gt; B[海洋离子库]&#10;  C[火山与热液] --&gt; B&#10;  B --&gt; D{停留时间长短}&#10;  D --&gt;|钠氯极长 上亿年| E[累积保持高浓度]&#10;  D --&gt;|钙短 易被生物移除| F[被造壳生物消耗沉降]&#10;  F --&gt; G[碳酸钙沉积物]&#10;  B --&gt; H[恒定比例定律&lt;br/&gt;主离子相对比例处处一致]\">flowchart TD\n  A[河流输入离子] --&gt; B[海洋离子库]\n  C[火山与热液] --&gt; B\n  B --&gt; D{停留时间长短}\n  D --&gt;|钠氯极长 上亿年| E[累积保持高浓度]\n  D --&gt;|钙短 易被生物移除| F[被造壳生物消耗沉降]\n  F --&gt; G[碳酸钙沉积物]\n  B --&gt; H[恒定比例定律&lt;br/&gt;主离子相对比例处处一致]</pre><p><strong>恒定比例定律</strong>（Marcet 原理）指出主要离子之间的比例在全球海洋几乎不变，原因是它们在海水中的&quot;停留时间&quot;远长于海洋自身约一千年的混合周期——海水还没来得及让局部成分跑偏，就已被环流搅匀。这条定律的实用价值在于：只要测一个离子（或电导率）就能推算总盐度。</p>\n<h2 id=\"盐度的地理分布\">盐度的地理分布</h2><p>虽然离子比例恒定，盐度的绝对值却随地理变化，由&quot;蒸发减降水&quot;这一淡水收支主导。副热带海域（南北纬约 25°）蒸发旺盛、降水稀少，是盐度高值带；赤道因强降水而偏低；高纬因低蒸发和融冰而偏低。封闭海更极端：红海蒸发强烈，盐度高达 40 以上；波罗的海大量河流注入，局部低至 7。</p>\n<p>盐度与温度共同塑造的密度差，正是<a href=\"../dynamics/currents-circulation\">海流与环流</a>中热盐环流的驱动力；而&quot;蒸发-降水&quot;格局的变化又与<a href=\"../dynamics/air-sea-interaction\">海气相互作用</a>紧密耦合——海洋盐度甚至被当作&quot;全球水循环放大&quot;的指示器：咸的更咸、淡的更淡。</p>\n<h2 id=\"溶解气体-氧与二氧化碳\">溶解气体：氧与二氧化碳</h2><p>海水中溶有大气来的气体，其溶解度随温度升高、盐度升高而下降——这是一个关键性质：变暖的海洋装不下那么多氧气。<strong>溶解氧</strong>在真光层因光合作用而充足，随深度下降，在数百米处常出现&quot;最小含氧层&quot;（OMZ），那里有机质分解耗氧而又难得到补充。全球变暖正在扩大这些低氧区，这一&quot;海洋脱氧&quot;趋势的生态后果见<a href=\"../human/climate-ocean\">气候变化与海洋</a>。</p>\n<p><strong>二氧化碳</strong>的故事更复杂，因为它进入海水后会发生化学反应，不只是简单溶解。海洋至今已吸收人类排放二氧化碳的约四分之一,这既缓冲了气候,也带来了代价。</p>\n<h2 id=\"碳酸盐系统与海洋酸化\">碳酸盐系统与海洋酸化</h2><p>二氧化碳溶于海水后建立一连串平衡：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">C</mi><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">O</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mo>+</mo><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">H</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">O</mi><mo>⇌</mo><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">H</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">C</mi><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">O</mi><mn>3</mn></msub><mo>⇌</mo><msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">H</mi><mo>+</mo></msup><mo>+</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">H</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">C</mi><msubsup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">O</mi><mn>3</mn><mo>−</mo></msubsup><mo>⇌</mo><mn>2</mn><msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">H</mi><mo>+</mo></msup><mo>+</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">C</mi><msubsup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">O</mi><mn>3</mn><mrow><mn>2</mn><mo>−</mo></mrow></msubsup></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\mathrm{CO_2 + H_2O \\rightleftharpoons H_2CO_3 \\rightleftharpoons H^+ + HCO_3^- \\rightleftharpoons 2H^+ + CO_3^{2-}}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.1205em;vertical-align:-0.2564em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathrm\">C</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathrm\">O</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathrm mtight\">2</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathrm\">H</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathrm mtight\">2</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mord mathrm\">O</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">⇌</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathrm\">H</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathrm mtight\">2</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mord mathrm\">C</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathrm\">O</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathrm mtight\">3</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">⇌</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathrm\">H</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8213em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.113em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mbin mtight\">+</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathrm\">HC</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathrm\">O</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8213em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.4436em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathrm mtight\">3</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.113em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mbin mtight\">−</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2564em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">⇌</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathrm\">2</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathrm\">H</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8213em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.113em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mbin mtight\">+</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathrm\">C</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathrm\">O</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8641em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.4436em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathrm mtight\">3</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.113em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathrm mtight\">2</span><span class=\"mord mtight\">−</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2564em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>这个<strong>碳酸盐缓冲系统</strong>让海水成为巨大的碳库，也维持着海水弱碱性的 pH。但代价直接写在方程里：海水每多吸收一份二氧化碳，就多产生氢离子 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">H</mi><mo>+</mo></msup></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\mathrm{H^+}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7713em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathrm\">H</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.7713em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mbin mtight\">+</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>，pH 随之下降，同时碳酸根 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">C</mi><msubsup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">O</mi><mn>3</mn><mrow><mn>2</mn><mo>−</mo></mrow></msubsup></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\mathrm{CO_3^{2-}}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.1205em;vertical-align:-0.2663em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathrm\">C</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathrm\">O</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8542em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.4337em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathrm mtight\">3</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.1031em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathrm mtight\">2</span><span class=\"mord mtight\">−</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2663em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 被消耗——而碳酸根正是珊瑚、贝类、翼足类造壳所需的原料。</p>\n<p>数据触目惊心：1950 至 2020 年间海洋表层平均 pH 从约 8.15 降到约 8.05，对应氢离子浓度上升约 30%（pH 是对数标度）。2025 年，&quot;海洋酸化&quot;被正式评估为已越过其行星边界，成为第七个被突破的行星边界；研究还发现全球次表层海洋已有高达 60% 越过了酸化危险阈值（来源：Planetary Health Check 2025；Scientific American 2025；大气二氧化碳浓度 2024 年已超 422 ppm）。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;  A[大气CO2上升 超422ppm] --&gt; B[海洋吸收CO2]&#10;  B --&gt; C[氢离子增多 pH下降]&#10;  B --&gt; D[碳酸根CO3被消耗]&#10;  C --&gt; E[海水酸化]&#10;  D --&gt; F[造壳生物难以钙化]&#10;  E --&gt; F&#10;  F --&gt; G[珊瑚 贝类 翼足类受损]\">graph TD\n  A[大气CO2上升 超422ppm] --&gt; B[海洋吸收CO2]\n  B --&gt; C[氢离子增多 pH下降]\n  B --&gt; D[碳酸根CO3被消耗]\n  C --&gt; E[海水酸化]\n  D --&gt; F[造壳生物难以钙化]\n  E --&gt; F\n  F --&gt; G[珊瑚 贝类 翼足类受损]</pre><p>酸化对生态系统的连锁影响在<a href=\"../ecology/marine-ecosystems\">海洋生态系统</a>与<a href=\"../human/pollution-conservation\">海洋污染与保护</a>中进一步展开。</p>\n<h2 id=\"营养盐与限制元素\">营养盐与限制元素</h2><p>除主要离子外，海水还含有浓度极低却决定生命的&quot;营养盐&quot;——硝酸盐、磷酸盐、硅酸盐。它们在真光层被浮游植物迅速耗尽，因而常成为限制初级生产的瓶颈；微量金属如铁更是大片&quot;高营养盐低叶绿素&quot;海区的真正限制因子。这些元素如何在表层消耗、深层再生、随环流回到表面，构成了完整的循环，是<a href=\"../ecology/biogeochemical-cycles\">生物地球化学循环</a>的核心内容，本篇只标出它们的化学身份。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>盐度由电导率测定，全球平均约 35 PSU；六种主要离子占溶解盐约 99%，且彼此比例处处恒定（恒定比例定律）。</li>\n<li>盐度绝对值由&quot;蒸发减降水&quot;主导：副热带高、赤道与高纬低，是水循环变化的指示器。</li>\n<li>溶解气体溶解度随升温下降，变暖海洋扩大最小含氧层；海洋已吸收约四分之一的人为二氧化碳。</li>\n<li>碳酸盐缓冲系统既让海洋成为巨大碳库，也直接导致酸化：2025 年海洋酸化越过第七个行星边界，表层 pH 较 1950 年降约 0.1。</li>\n<li>硝酸盐、磷酸盐、硅酸盐及微量铁是限制初级生产的营养盐，其循环留待生物地球化学循环篇详述。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"海水化学与盐度","id":"海水化学与盐度"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念：盐度与主要离子","id":"核心概念-盐度与主要离子"},{"level":2,"text":"盐度的地理分布","id":"盐度的地理分布"},{"level":2,"text":"溶解气体：氧与二氧化碳","id":"溶解气体-氧与二氧化碳"},{"level":2,"text":"碳酸盐系统与海洋酸化","id":"碳酸盐系统与海洋酸化"},{"level":2,"text":"营养盐与限制元素","id":"营养盐与限制元素"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"海洋的物理性质","url":"/l-doc-books/h/geography-geopolitics/oceanography/foundations/physical-properties"},"next":{"title":"海底地形与板块","url":"/l-doc-books/h/geography-geopolitics/oceanography/foundations/seafloor-plates"}}